    "contentHtml": "<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Como o pr&oacute;prio nome diz, o <strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">CONFRONTO</strong> nasceu para possibilitar que nossos clientes&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">confrontem as informa&ccedil;&otilde;es contidas nos extratos banc&aacute;rios com suas movimenta&ccedil;&otilde;es financeiras.</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Dessa maneira, consegue de maneira r&aacute;pida, segura e simples identificar um determinado lan&ccedil;amento em um extrato banc&aacute;rio.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \"><strong>Para melhor contextualizar:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \">Imagine aquele extrato do Ita&uacute; onde tem o lan&ccedil;amento <strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">SISPAG FORNECEDORES</strong>. &Eacute; preciso saber quem &eacute; ou quais s&atilde;o (as vezes tem mais do que um) o(s) fornecedor(es) que participaram daquela movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \">Com o CONFRONTO, voc&ecirc; poder&aacute; identificar facilmente quem &eacute; esse fornecedor, pois o sistema far&aacute; o cruzamento do seu extrato com a movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o financeira onde consta o nome do fornecedor.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \">Movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o financeira pode ser comprovantes de pagamentos fornecidos pelo banco, pode ser o controle financeiro do seu cliente e etc.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;  background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 602px; height: 312px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/A5CDCC82E89D2D29F154E3234A74CBBA?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423874&Signature=22UhnTBZ0k0wxgr6S08fRn4tv58%3D\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; \">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\" font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-\"></p>",
