    "dislikesCount": 0,
    "contentHtml": "<h1 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"226\"><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\" draggable=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kjqyKRXJ41w?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" height=\"360\" width=\"640\" class=\"fr-draggable\"></iframe></span><br></h1><h1 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"226\"><br></h1><h1 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"226\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">O atalho presente no sistema na guia Ajuda ir&aacute; encaminhar o usu&aacute;rio para a plataforma de chamados do Movidesk</span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/EE7725D6D9186ED35AB180ABCB138F43?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423887&Signature=gfQpUW8JK40w8hemnk4JMKLhTuQ%3D\"></span><br></p><h1 id=\"isPasted\" data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"226\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Abertura de Chamados &ndash; Plataforma Movidesk</strong></span></h1><p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"436\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Caso precise do suporte t&eacute;cnico ou queira reportar alguma situa&ccedil;&atilde;o, utilize nossa plataforma oficial de atendimento: o <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"359\">Movidesk</strong>. Siga os passos abaixo para criar sua conta e abrir um chamado corretamente.</span></p><h2 data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"473\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. Criando sua conta no Movidesk</span></h2><ol data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"817\"><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"574\"><p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"574\">Acesse: <a data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"574\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com\">https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com</a></p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"645\"><p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"645\">Clique em <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"606\">Crie uma conta</strong> (localizado abaixo do bot&atilde;o de login).</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"761\"><p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"707\">Na janela que ser&aacute; aberta, preencha os campos solicitados:</p><ul style=\"font-size: initial; font-family: initial;\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"761\"><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"717\"><p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"717\">Nome</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"729\"><p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"729\">E-mail</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"740\"><p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"740\">Senha</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"761\"><p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"761\">Confirmar senha</p></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"817\"><p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"817\">Ap&oacute;s preencher os dados, clique no bot&atilde;o <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"816\">Enviar</strong>.</p></li></ol><p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"895\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sua conta estar&aacute; criada e voc&ecirc; ser&aacute; direcionado para o painel da plataforma.</span></p><p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"895\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img style=\"width: 988px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/F1B364148BBF3B8AC7514126DB59122D?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423887&Signature=i3T9GiW6KHnNA975KrG5YIGmtPM%3D\"></span></p><p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"895\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/C36667DF40200D39E627A11A03C8033B?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423887&Signature=jLBVWhKoUyMUbSiroWntrG8QVSA%3D\"></span></p><hr data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\"><h2 data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"938\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. Acessando e criando um chamado</span></h2><ol data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1344\"><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"989\"><p data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"989\">Fa&ccedil;a login com seu e-mail e senha cadastrados.</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1054\"><p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1054\">No canto superior esquerdo da tela, clique no bot&atilde;o de <strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1053\">+</strong>.</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1104\"><p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1104\">Em seguida, selecione a op&ccedil;&atilde;o <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1103\">Novo Ticket</strong>.</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1296\"><p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1137\">Preencha os seguintes campos:</p><ul style=\"font-size: initial; font-family: initial;\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1296\"><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1207\"><p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1207\"><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1154\">Assunto</strong>: escreva de forma clara o tema principal do chamado.</p></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1296\"><p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1296\"><strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1225\">Mensagem</strong>: descreva detalhadamente sua d&uacute;vida, solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o ou o erro encontrado.</p></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1344\"><p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1344\">Ap&oacute;s preencher, clique em <strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1343\">Enviar Ticket</strong>.</p></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1344\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/ED936232B243ADD41C183458E76BD998?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423887&Signature=Zn2UO9rfn6zy%2B13g9K0%2BJcaSskg%3D\"></span></p><p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1344\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/B757981A09097870B49DED62AD3A108A?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423887&Signature=GFzbAcvkLQnIKA8nwXjUaKBqkOE%3D\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1423\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pronto! O seu chamado ser&aacute; enviado e nossa equipe de suporte ser&aacute; notificada.</span></p><hr data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1428\"><p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1539\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Se tiver qualquer dificuldade durante esse processo, entre em contato conosco para que possamos lhe auxiliar.</span></p>",
