    "contentHtml": "<p id=\"isPasted\" style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Essa op&ccedil;&atilde;o possibilita que voc&ecirc; &nbsp;gere um arquivo em PDF com a movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o que consta na tela principal do sistema, em um modelo de Extrato Banc&aacute;rio.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Para acessar, v&aacute; em <strong>R</strong><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><strong>elat&oacute;rios&nbsp;</strong>&gt; Extrato em PDF.</strong></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/F64EDEA610E02E5BB23401D8FF0BFD07?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423889&Signature=YLpUtQXhyGkM2eDgjOzcDk7RYt8%3D\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></strong></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Ao clicar na op&ccedil;&atilde;o, ser&aacute; aberta uma tela para voc&ecirc; pr&eacute;-visualizar o relat&oacute;rio e Imprimir ou Salvar o PDF.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/1F9985C551882CF52CF1F819037818EF?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423889&Signature=smfuuGqfvDU7DJ0nosntDlLgB8w%3D\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-\"><br></p>",
