    "contentHtml": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Cadastro da Contabilidade </span><span class=\"fr-emoticon fr-deletable\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👑</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Esta &eacute; a tela de informa&ccedil;&otilde;es da Empresa/Escrit&oacute;rio em que atua.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>N&atilde;o &eacute; necess&aacute;rio&nbsp;</strong>realizar quaisquer altera&ccedil;&otilde;es nesta tela, pois nossa equipe de <strong>CS&nbsp;</strong>a deixa completamente configurada.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/movidesk-files/F3F45DC290978C9AD8D749052D30B7F0?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAWSRCTWGBHCVKCQGD&Expires=1789423912&Signature=bWErgnvb1V2nbTU0O0VHgS5JmJo%3D\"></span></p>",
